{
  "scope": "batch002 newly delivered recordings only; full catalog remains incomplete",
  "synthesized": 25,
  "retained": 418,
  "pending": 397,
  "new_bytes_this_batch": 810912,
  "new_voice_bytes_total": 957342,
  "total_new_recordings": 28,
  "previous_batch_bytes_unchanged": true,
  "manifest_sha256": "8fc36e2f78786ebbe93182227a14229f68b0f4786f32ab6e4272bec3b14a2e44",
  "files": [
    {
      "speaker": "kael",
      "text": "The kitchen is working. There is a route and a dry refuge. We have tried the shifts, not just written them down.",
      "path": "res://assets_external/audio/voices/community/483d18fce81ac0f52cf7bdcb826f2b32790052884485f1fbbdbc2a23ad88433b.ogg",
      "sha256": "cef626014881b54b85f111f9ca5a657a03f409b156aa1fe1102835b0b2a5c0aa",
      "bytes": 50646,
      "duration_seconds": 6.605875
    },
    {
      "speaker": "white_hart",
      "text": "Then there are two more things you may attempt. Share stewardship only with the keepers who still freely offer it. An empty place remains empty until somebody chooses it.",
      "path": "res://assets_external/audio/voices/community/7f5715994b2f9eb8b4445c997e0ef5b3ad0d0c8b2d30cd8057a9e89c66bada0f.ogg",
      "sha256": "b8bd44cddce9e919bb7d58f1edd5102c0b83d9ea8a771cca265f5eef592cf0e8",
      "bytes": 71811,
      "duration_seconds": 10.302
    },
    {
      "speaker": "kael",
      "text": "And if we leave?",
      "path": "res://assets_external/audio/voices/community/1e59d0375db48abffb112af92a027dd3ebf4cbbf399d22409ea5361b5fff7d4e.ogg",
      "sha256": "94987aca92d770eee688e66c8e45b39b0773e8c627cc63d330299c3aad2bdbc9",
      "bytes": 9843,
      "duration_seconds": 1.108625
    },
    {
      "speaker": "white_hart",
      "text": "Carry the people and their human records through the prepared passage. Undo this boundary, and its shelter will not follow. Neither will the complete account I hold.",
      "path": "res://assets_external/audio/voices/community/969ae6f962ce8ed373c16c5886827f4c0448e16ca0d59dbfd02450914491ff64.ogg",
      "sha256": "c8eca12bdbbb5431c93790ebef462ca7488ffd5a0360a3c20b8450b88bf219b1",
      "bytes": 69354,
      "duration_seconds": 10.238
    },
    {
      "speaker": "kael",
      "text": "A rota can fail. A refuge can fail. Neither makes the old choices disappear.",
      "path": "res://assets_external/audio/voices/community/bca633424e18f8fe77c93c4f4c0f1afc56762c45af3c0fa9f2a6c3a1e8571d83.ogg",
      "sha256": "37b1372289107e21a3b6f33c076f6e715b6559add0931426e23dca4876b6f729",
      "bytes": 39609,
      "duration_seconds": 5.398625
    },
    {
      "speaker": "anwen",
      "text": "There are spaces beside the names now. For the next shift, and for anyone who needs to stop.",
      "path": "res://assets_external/audio/voices/community/2aaf391c3816cf6215b59c5cebd85949a289152f0b6008e1ca157e5a74bb0712.ogg",
      "sha256": "ddea120c67c7727bb94f4603bf1bf4fe886a48ed399456a808db6433ef4767d4",
      "bytes": 38293,
      "duration_seconds": 5.231958333333333
    },
    {
      "speaker": "kael",
      "text": "Who fills a space when somebody leaves?",
      "path": "res://assets_external/audio/voices/community/386328e9f7755e3ac5f8d25fb2dc854fd1010a92f203a7c8eadac08d1a3cd54d.ogg",
      "sha256": "edf8f0aac9f0e7d4e8b41a17d82e6098223086be706d487306d2bb79f32c9a5d",
      "bytes": 17970,
      "duration_seconds": 2.2392916666666665
    },
    {
      "speaker": "anwen",
      "text": "Someone who offers. We ask. We wait. If nobody can, we write that the work is uncovered.",
      "path": "res://assets_external/audio/voices/community/33df7e8b0e251b371d8b4ea207c83c3267e1788834af482ad969c87595f0bb5c.ogg",
      "sha256": "ada07b433c808a00fb42ddb66c3305c301d985a2e9572c3584fd9c76084eb96a",
      "bytes": 37529,
      "duration_seconds": 5.474
    },
    {
      "speaker": "kael",
      "text": "The Hart did not make the work smaller.",
      "path": "res://assets_external/audio/voices/community/cb7afbf6e9908a36719282ed97bb3bf7f1c3619e88d005b00ea24ff5dbbe4cb8.ogg",
      "sha256": "eaf9d8c186054b863038bd4e3cac641d9896b7191aae2a2cd503bca10bcc2500",
      "bytes": 17104,
      "duration_seconds": 2.1013333333333333
    },
    {
      "speaker": "anwen",
      "text": "No. It can no longer make one person carry it in silence.",
      "path": "res://assets_external/audio/voices/community/8ccb1fd3bba5809667665b493bad173943ec34cec8fa2959d7b3c96b1b8e2c10.ogg",
      "sha256": "08541087a02030e71c35237c73dff83289c67db95f7c1f40f077ad2991446b8c",
      "bytes": 26791,
      "duration_seconds": 3.664
    },
    {
      "speaker": "tor",
      "text": "A hinge, a rail, and the kitchen latch. Those are the jobs. Nobody promised the iron would stop wearing out.",
      "path": "res://assets_external/audio/voices/community/a8fc4890e28813bdcd2a8d8219a67f9ede162c504fc6dc22453fe08db9484b29.ogg",
      "sha256": "aae0691ab6003152fe47591ca372bb503b5c380a41409bfda6cedfabb6d419c3",
      "bytes": 48737,
      "duration_seconds": 7.528625
    },
    {
      "speaker": "rook",
      "text": "The rota leaves a gap for weather. Sensible. Weather has never signed anything I gave it.",
      "path": "res://assets_external/audio/voices/community/7e3d0b58e243f31a0b8025c63ef1f7ccc9d1a6929dc428a996498093585371d3.ogg",
      "sha256": "f8f1b52912e6ab087b95f5da0508376ac8f5748aefa47499305c915e01c55069",
      "bytes": 39937,
      "duration_seconds": 6.024666666666667
    },
    {
      "speaker": "kael",
      "text": "And if a keeper withdraws?",
      "path": "res://assets_external/audio/voices/community/c190ce9e6d13f9513589ee449cc6339f884fd71a91b586347b5586fb1333fe18.ogg",
      "sha256": "622df2ca8cf1481140e5960f051092bbbe7f5b562922f8a908db0dd2cff67195",
      "bytes": 13795,
      "duration_seconds": 1.588
    },
    {
      "speaker": "tor",
      "text": "We close the unsafe part until somebody can do it. A promise is not a brace.",
      "path": "res://assets_external/audio/voices/community/8b0e20cad26e2c6022c8179ee96e648a1974d87fc6fa1a16220a8bc4cc385623.ogg",
      "sha256": "bb2196e0acf6d4a26cd871afd6ae36b82e6def0dbe7f8bf45b6cb4c6e9dfa5c7",
      "bytes": 36983,
      "duration_seconds": 5.6
    },
    {
      "speaker": "rook",
      "text": "Your shift is still on the board. Unless you have something to tell the board.",
      "path": "res://assets_external/audio/voices/community/a478f790464256862ac81c7c3973333536c354dd7e06e075f569a7261bbba78d.ogg",
      "sha256": "2be866dd79dc9619ebd07e87c6edc952d9167c13721f7d6008efb704f428a0bb",
      "bytes": 32088,
      "duration_seconds": 4.645333333333333
    },
    {
      "speaker": "nera",
      "text": "The passage is open. The watch still changes at the posted hour.",
      "path": "res://assets_external/audio/voices/community/d7e98e3604ac77e22c9b033d5f82867e5a6a68a0fad66d9c287e521920318d07.ogg",
      "sha256": "2709dc49efba3638402eb845d3f50819983b4484169500f3e2e9ea6de00b6c80",
      "bytes": 30818,
      "duration_seconds": 4.020666666666667
    },
    {
      "speaker": "nera",
      "text": "Some people stayed. Some went on. Their shares were packed either way.",
      "path": "res://assets_external/audio/voices/community/c8804045f152af8e9c3e07c37be80fe13a3ba93f5a65aff1688f9c7e02aeea3a.ogg",
      "sha256": "350c2c3961e6fb80191c51b389550d342f33a205c9cb3f633fbdfbb9ec6a0408",
      "bytes": 29218,
      "duration_seconds": 4.0179583333333335
    },
    {
      "speaker": "kael",
      "text": "Do the keepers agree about everything?",
      "path": "res://assets_external/audio/voices/community/afdcf4256cf059118f5397a7aeb6b458229f74bd8fc3963fde5a5af739931d3a.ogg",
      "sha256": "ba7720d23a8a3c1e17cdad34e820f154daffbcf119f8d09a146bfd7a198b73bd",
      "bytes": 17533,
      "duration_seconds": 2.0813333333333333
    },
    {
      "speaker": "nera",
      "text": "They agree about the next handover. Tomorrow we may have to talk again.",
      "path": "res://assets_external/audio/voices/community/b0b715f497c315a535a3a2fc6ca0277a9adad039aad9599c6153d699807a6c30.ogg",
      "sha256": "daae992e77c3816143eed53985eb36af329df0e1c1f99974c59a8fe1397aee0b",
      "bytes": 30902,
      "duration_seconds": 4.191333333333334
    },
    {
      "speaker": "kael",
      "text": "Then we keep the empty places visible.",
      "path": "res://assets_external/audio/voices/community/1a35949a315bbb2a3fafdd7b924dd6ccac1150717a31a8467a37cae87c697daa.ogg",
      "sha256": "ef02c4a2c06034dbe729f422553c5892b97027c8a65e67c7f46933234283e3e2",
      "bytes": 19642,
      "duration_seconds": 2.3146666666666667
    },
    {
      "speaker": "nera",
      "text": "And we ask before writing a name in one.",
      "path": "res://assets_external/audio/voices/community/42d586cb52e08c42f24e90f77ba8cc6180d2f3e4b10b788dece85f4279a3004f.ogg",
      "sha256": "bb1850886494a22ceddeac49d9b7ed8705f36427d8c710e63241637504244dd0",
      "bytes": 19731,
      "duration_seconds": 2.474666666666667
    },
    {
      "speaker": "vale",
      "text": "The orders, the signatures and the accounts we recovered are packed. These are human records. They remain evidence.",
      "path": "res://assets_external/audio/voices/community/077c481810191b6ec107dcf13d3e16e173a8451c33149f7b7904fc94cd5c802b.ogg",
      "sha256": "6db3d87675d2a716e16e6e32154d5e81f3d016a52bc34ebda1ea8249adefefcb",
      "bytes": 45858,
      "duration_seconds": 6.509333333333333
    },
    {
      "speaker": "kael",
      "text": "What is missing?",
      "path": "res://assets_external/audio/voices/community/2dfa3740ccc309cbdc2d6aa90d1c0ad34533456d029f8d98a9c4118b073c7406.ogg",
      "sha256": "020b757ed3c26294c8279e575436d537d57e59764683a62ac24633ead9a12179",
      "bytes": 10148,
      "duration_seconds": 1.12
    },
    {
      "speaker": "vale",
      "text": "What only the Hart remembered. We cannot fill that absence by guessing.",
      "path": "res://assets_external/audio/voices/community/1f0ccf583335955aa4996de935624a892844379992f416ff9a554b0e748b0a34.ogg",
      "sha256": "faa0dc4c7b6aa1995e7779b14d1eb6b41d011d268bfae7724c785eb6691ea940",
      "bytes": 32050,
      "duration_seconds": 4.1706666666666665
    },
    {
      "speaker": "kael",
      "text": "Leave the notice where someone returning can find it.",
      "path": "res://assets_external/audio/voices/community/2d632aa77ce6444d64d5eef938fe41da3bde09f2c7219af2f9ebb6c8e7753823.ogg",
      "sha256": "7f542747d62b8173d03100fda44b8858c0570ad91881dd7ea169a1da0a8eadc3",
      "bytes": 24522,
      "duration_seconds": 3.021333333333333
    }
  ],
  "listening_acceptance": false,
  "gameplay_acceptance": false
}
